---
import WritingLayout from '../layouts/WritingLayout.astro';
---
<WritingLayout title="Privacy" description="How this portfolio measures visits, and how to opt out.">
  <article class="privacy-copy" data-no-track><p>PORTFOLIO / PRIVACY</p><h1>a little transparency.</h1><p>This portfolio uses first-party analytics to understand what people find useful. It measures page visits, link and button clicks (including resume clicks), scroll milestones, and time spent actively viewing a page. It does not record what you type, record your screen, or identify you by name.</p><p>A random browser ID helps count return visits. Approximate city and country are derived from your IP address by the hosting provider. They may reflect a VPN or your network rather than your actual location. Raw IP addresses are not stored in the analytics database.</p><p>Events are kept for up to 90 days. The private dashboard is password protected. Clearing your browser storage creates a new ID. Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control are respected.</p><button id="privacy-toggle">Turn off analytics in this browser</button><p id="privacy-status" aria-live="polite"></p><p>This choice applies to this browser on this device. Questions? <a href="mailto:abdullahom07@gmail.com">abdullahom07@gmail.com</a></p></article>
</WritingLayout>
<script>
  const button=document.getElementById('privacy-toggle')!,status=document.getElementById('privacy-status')!;
  function update(){try{const off=localStorage.getItem('portfolio:analytics:off')==='1';button.textContent=off?'Allow analytics in this browser':'Turn off analytics in this browser';status.textContent=off?'Analytics is turned off in this browser.':'Analytics is allowed, unless your browser sends Do Not Track or Global Privacy Control.';}catch{status.textContent='Browser storage is unavailable; tracking is disabled.';}}
  button.addEventListener('click',()=>{try{if(localStorage.getItem('portfolio:analytics:off')==='1')localStorage.removeItem('portfolio:analytics:off');else{localStorage.setItem('portfolio:analytics:off','1');localStorage.removeItem('portfolio:visitor');sessionStorage.removeItem('portfolio:session');}update();}catch{update();}});update();
</script>
<style>.privacy-copy{max-width:700px;margin:auto}.privacy-copy h1{font-size:48px;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:25px 0}.privacy-copy p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted);margin:20px 0}.privacy-copy p:first-child{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--lime)}.privacy-copy button{background:var(--lime);color:#14200e;padding:14px 20px;border:0;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer}.privacy-copy a{color:var(--lime)}</style>
